# Familee - one line ending, everywhere
#
# The repository stores LF and every checkout gets LF, whatever core.autocrlf of the machine says.
# Without this a Windows checkout arrives with CRLF: the formatter then reports every file as
# unformatted, and a build that rewrites tsconfig.json leaves a change nobody made. Linux, macOS and
# the container are unaffected - they already read LF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Files that are not text are stored and checked out byte for byte.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.dump binary
